{"id":"55595cd890aabc69","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Product Topology Basic Open","display":"df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open — ZFC Topo10 Product Topology Basic Open","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open — ZFC Topo10 Product Topology Basic Open","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open — ZFC Topo10 Product Topology Basic Open"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space\">58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set\">58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,I,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal T,u,F,x\\in V\">\\(B,I,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal T,u,F,x\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal X(i)=X_i\">\\(\\mathcal X(i)=X_i\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T(i)=\\tau_i\">\\(\\mathcal T(i)=\\tau_i\\)</span> (set-coded carrier and topology families)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typed function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (topological-space predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (finite-set predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ProductTopologyBasicOpen}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ProductTopologyBasicOpen}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology\\text{-}basic\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ProductTopologyBasicOpen}_S(B,I,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal X))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal T,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal T))\\land(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal X(i),\\mathcal T(i)))\\land\\exists u,F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(u,I,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land F\\subseteq I\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(F)\\land(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u(i)\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\land(i\\notin F\\to u(i)=\\mathcal X(i))\\bigr))\\land B=\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(u)):\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(x(i)\\in u(i))\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology\\text{-}basic\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ProductTopologyBasicOpen}_S(B,I,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal X))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal T,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal T))\\land(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal X(i),\\mathcal T(i)))\\land\\exists u,F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(u,I,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land F\\subseteq I\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(F)\\land(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u(i)\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\land(i\\notin F\\to u(i)=\\mathcal X(i))\\bigr))\\land B=\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(u)):\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(x(i)\\in u(i))\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> is the actual cylinder subset of the product, not the coordinate family <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span>; only the finite support <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> may differ from the full factors.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3aa1f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B,I,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal T,u,F,x\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal X(i)=X_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T(i)=\\tau_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ProductTopologyBasicOpen}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology\\text{-}basic\\text{-}open} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ProductTopologyBasicOpen}_S(B,I,\\mathcal X,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal X,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal X))\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\mathcal T,I,\\operatorname{ran}(\\mathcal T))\\land(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(\\mathcal X(i),\\mathcal T(i)))\\land\\exists u,F\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(u,I,\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land F\\subseteq I\\land\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(F)\\land(\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(u(i)\\in\\mathcal T(i)\\land(i\\notin F\\to u(i)=\\mathcal X(i))\\bigr))\\land B=\\{x\\in\\mathcal P(I\\times\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(u)):\\mathrm{Function}(x,I,\\bigcup\\operatorname{ran}(u))\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;(x(i)\\in u(i))\\}\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":1883,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3669","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open.md|58-df-zfc-topo10-product-topology-basic-open]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a